# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
# The first run of the recovery test of a design whose CAM section this
# MitCad cannot read (mitcad#2587; tools/ui-scripts/unreadable-cam-recovery.mitcad-ui
# is the next): cam.mitcad (a 10 mm cube whose CAM has two setups with one
# id, and a field a newer MitCad wrote) opens with both warnings; a 5 mm
# cube is added; once the change is autosaved (every 2 s for the test,
# MITCAD_TEST_AUTOSAVE_SECONDS) the session ends as a killed one would, its
# autosaved files left for the next run.
wait-idle
expect-ever 'CAM of .*/cam[.]mitcad not read: two setups or operations have the same id'
expect-ever 'Unknown fields of .*/cam[.]mitcad not read: future_notes$'
expect-model-bodies 1 1000
mark
model-command '{"cmd":"add_feature","def":{"type":"box","plane":{"type":"origin","plane":"xy"},"corner":[20,0],"length":5,"width":5,"height":5,"operation":"new_body"}}'
expect-model-bodies 2 1125
expect-document-modified yes
wait-log '^Autosaved cam[.]mitcad: ' 30
kill
